{% extends 'layout/frontend.twig' %}
{% block content %}
    <div class="container bg-white">
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-lg-12">
                <h1 class="page-header">Members Guide</h1>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-lg-12">
                <h1 class="page-header">Frequently Asked Questions</h1>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row mb-320" style="padding-bottom:20px">
            <div class="col-md-12">
                <div class="row">
                    <div class="panel-group" id="accordion">
                        <div class="panel panel-default">
                            <div class="panel-heading"> <a data-toggle="collapse" data-parent="#accordion" href="#collapseOne"> <strong>How and when do I have to register?</strong></a></div>
                            <div id="collapseOne" class="panel-collapse collapse in">
                                <div class="panel-body">
                                    <p>Members must register once every program year. 2019 program starts 1 May 2019 – 31 March 2020 at <a href="http://www.nissan-events.com.au/nissanelite/reg">www.nissan-events.com.au/nissanelite/reg</a>.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="panel panel-default">
                            <div class="panel-heading"> <a data-toggle="collapse" data-parent="#accordion" href="#collapseTwo"><strong>How do I join the ELITE Program?</strong></a> </div>
                            <div id="collapseTwo" class="panel-collapse collapse">
                                <div class="panel-body">
                                    <p>Refer to “Are you eligible?” on the login page.  You must be enrolled on the Nissan Dealer User Management portal and hold a 5-digit registration number and be in an ELITE Program eligible role.  You will be automatically rolled over into Nissan ELITE Club, receiving a Welcome Pack with your details, and notification for your compulsory registration at <a href="http://www.nissan-events.com.au/nissanelite/reg">www.nissan-events.com.au/nissanelite/reg</a>. 
                                        On completion you will receive an e-Mail confirmation and only then be eligible to earn Awards/Rewards within Nissan ELITE Program.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="panel panel-default">
                            <div class="panel-heading"> <a data-toggle="collapse" data-parent="#accordion" href="#collapseThree"> <strong>Am I eligible to participate in Sprint Incentives?</strong> </a> </div>
                            <div id="collapseThree" class="panel-collapse collapse">
                                <div class="panel-body">
                                    <p>Yes, providing the criteria is applicable to your role and all AC & Sprint Incentive T&Cs are met.  Nissan ELITE registration is compulsory for all incentives.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="panel panel-default">
                            <div class="panel-heading"> <a data-toggle="collapse" data-parent="#accordion" href="#collapseFour"> <strong>Am I eligible in Nissan ELITE if I am enrolled on the Nissan Dealer User Management portal?</strong> </a> </div>
                            <div id="collapseFour" class="panel-collapse collapse">
                                <div class="panel-body">
                                    <p>If you are enrolled on the Nissan Dealer User Management portal in an eligible ELITE role you are a member of ELITE but NOT an eligible member until you have registered in the current program period. Every member must register once in every ELITE program period (current program 1 May – 31 March) to be eligible.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="panel panel-default">
                            <div class="panel-heading"> <a data-toggle="collapse" data-parent="#accordion" href="#collapseFive"> <strong>What is the Nissan ELITE program period?</strong> </a> </div>
                            <div id="collapseFive" class="panel-collapse collapse">
                                <div class="panel-body">
                                    <p>For 2019 - 1 May 2019 – 31 March 2020</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="panel panel-default">
                            <div class="panel-heading"> <a data-toggle="collapse" data-parent="#accordion" href="#collapseSix"> <strong>Where can I find my metrics and criteria for Nissan ELITE?</strong> </a> </div>
                            <div id="collapseSix" class="panel-collapse collapse">
                                <div class="panel-body">
                                    <p>Go to the Member Guide tab and click your department/role tab. You will find all information about Nissan ELITE here.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
{% endblock %}